## the snapshot's lines for it
function os.next_ticket(text,integer,double precision) kind f owner os_engine language sql returns text definer f volatility v strict f parallel u leakproof f cost 100 rows 0 config - arguments prefix text DEFAULT 'T-'::text, width integer DEFAULT 6, scale double precision DEFAULT 0.1
function-body os.next_ticket(text,integer,double precision) \n  select prefix || lpad(nextval('os.ticket_seq')::text, width, '0') || (scale * 1)::text\n
grant function os.next_ticket(text,integer,double precision) to os_engine EXECUTE  by os_engine 
grant function os.next_ticket(text,integer,double precision) to os_intake EXECUTE  by os_engine 
